    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d251">

                <pb facs="0346" n="272" sameAs="frus:frus1866p1/pg272"/>

                <head>Mr. Bigelow to Mr. Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 241.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States</hi>,
                                <hi rendition="#italic">Paris</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-01-12"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 12, 1866.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to transmit a translation
                    of a correspondence which has recently passed between the honorary presidents of
                    the Comite Francaise de l’Abolition d’Esclavage and myself, in reference to your
                    recent proclamation announcing the termination of slavery in the United
                    States.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, with great respect, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JOHN BIGELOW.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, Washington, D.C.</hi></p>
                </postscript>





